flowchart TD
    Guest[Khách vãng lai] --> Web[Trình duyệt / Bootstrap / Blade]
    Customer[Customer] --> Web
    Admin[Admin] --> Web
    Web --> Router[Laravel Routes + Middleware]
    Router --> Auth[Authentication / Profile]
    Router --> Store[Shop: Products / Cart / Checkout / Orders]
    Router --> Manage[Admin: Categories / Products / Orders / Dashboard / CSV]
    Store --> ORM[Eloquent ORM / Transaction]
    Manage --> ORM
    Auth --> ORM
    ORM --> MySQL[(MySQL / MariaDB)]
    Store --> Session[(Session Cart)]
    Manage --> FileStorage[(Public Storage / Images)]
    Web --> Ajax[AJAX add-to-cart]
    Ajax --> Router
